		<description><![CDATA[<p>Ariel Rechtshaid, producer, musician and writer, worked with Madonna on some tracks for her upcoming album Rebel Heart. In an [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-learned-whats-name-says-ariel-rechtshaid/20150124">&#8220;From Madonna, I Learned What’s In A Name&#8221;, says Ariel Rechtshaid.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
