		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=3688</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Few days ago the complete Madonna&#8216;s Rebel Heart track-list was revealed and what leaped out was the name of Mike [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/mike-tyson-madonna-awesome-serene-person-shes-trying-save-world/20150124">Mike Tyson: &#8220;Madonna is an awesome, serene person. She’s trying to save the world.&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Few days ago the complete <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s <strong>Rebel Heart</strong> track-list was revealed and what leaped out was the name of <strong>Mike Tyson</strong> among the guest stars. Interviewed by <a href="http://www.rollingstone.com/music/features/mike-tyson-talks-intense-crazy-cameo-on-madonnas-rebel-heart-lp-20150123" target="_blank">Rolling Stone</a>, the boxing champion explains his view of <strong>Madonna</strong> and the collaboration with her in <strong>Iconic</strong>:</p>
<p><em>Madonna calls you and tells you to come somewhere, you go. I didn’t know what the hell I was going there for. I’m just there having a good time and hanging out with Madonna. She has her producer there and I go into the studio and I didn’t know if she wanted me to talk or rap. I just go in there and start talking. I’m talking about my life and things that I have endured. I’m saying some really crazy stuff. It was really intense.</em></p>
<blockquote><p>Madonna is an awesome, serene person. She’s trying to do something that since the beginning of time has been the most difficult thing to do: Save the world. I commend her for that. She is a fighter in every sense of the word and from an intergalactic perspective.</p></blockquote>
<p>Concerning Adi Lederman, the alleged hacker who stole Madonna’s songs:<br />
<em>It’s an invasion of privacy. It’s totally counterproductive to what our so-called constitution is all about. But I’m not in the position to pass judgment on somebody like that, but [what happens to him] shouldn’t be something nice.</em></p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/mike-tyson-madonna-awesome-serene-person-shes-trying-save-world/20150124">Mike Tyson: &#8220;Madonna is an awesome, serene person. She’s trying to save the world.&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
