				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna</strong>, interviewed by <a href="http://www.rollingstone.com/music/features/madonna-strikes-back-inside-her-star-packed-new-album-rebel-heart-20150114" target="_blank">Rolling Stone</a>, talks about one of her most in-sync creative partners, <strong>Nicki Minaj</strong>, who appeared also on MDNA&#8217;s Give Me All Your Luvin&#8217; and I Don&#8217;t Give A.<br />
Nicki sings a ferocious rap on <strong>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna</strong>.<br />
