				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Diplo</strong> talked about working with <strong>Madonna</strong>, again. This time he talked to the <strong><a href="http://www.asianage.com/music/what-diplo-matic-dude-102" target="_blank">Asian Age</a></strong>.<br />
Check it out:</p>
<blockquote><p>I loved working with Madonna. The tracks have come out great and crazy- sounding. She is one of those few artists who started the trend of reinventing themselves before anybody else. She kind of began that trend of actually coming back with a refreshingly new look, music style and fresh tunes; winning it and hitting the top of the charts. She was ready to experiment while collaborating with me and was very open-minded to my ideas.</p></blockquote>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/diplo-tracks-madonna-great-crazy-sounding/20141210">Diplo: &#8220;The tracks with Madonna are great and crazy-sounding!&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
