		<description><![CDATA[<p>OneRepublic&#8216;s frontman Ryan Tedder revealed to The Mirror 3 Am that he is working with Madonna for her upcoming album. [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/onerepublics-ryan-tedder-new-madonnas-music-best-stuff-decade/20141208">OneRepublic&#8217;s Ryan Tedder: &#8220;Madonna&#8217;s new music is her best stuff in over a decade.&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
