				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>OneRepublic</strong>&#8216;s frontman <strong>Ryan Tedder</strong> revealed to <strong><a href="http://www.mirror.co.uk/3am/celebrity-news/simon-cowell-guru-ryan-tedder-4766488" target="_blank">The Mirror 3 Am</a></strong> that he is working with <strong>Madonna</strong> for her upcoming album.<br />
<strong>Ryan Tedder</strong> is well known for being a songwriter for very big artists, such as U2, Adele, Beyoncé, Maroon 5, Ellie Goulding, Jennifer Lopez, Leona Lewis, Gym Class Heroes, One Direction, James Blunt, Taylor Swift and Gwen Stefani.<br />
Check out his words: </p>
<blockquote><p>Madonna&#8217;s new music is her best stuff in over a decade, it’s really strong.<br />
The tracks I’ve done with her are really hard to explain.</p></blockquote>
<p>About the song leaked few days ago, he added: </p>
<blockquote><p>I was actually working on something with Madonna when her tracks leaked.<br />
So I panicked because I thought it was the song I was working on, but luckily it wasn’t.<br />
People have way too much time on their hands.</p></blockquote>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/onerepublics-ryan-tedder-new-madonnas-music-best-stuff-decade/20141208">OneRepublic&#8217;s Ryan Tedder: &#8220;Madonna&#8217;s new music is her best stuff in over a decade.&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
